# YuriVerse Environment Configuration
# All primary APIs work 100% out of the box with NO keys required!
# You can optionally fill in custom keys below if you have them.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. CORE APIS (No API Key Required - Ready Out of the Box)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - AniList (GraphQL): Public API for Anime & Manga metadata.
# - Jikan (REST): Public MyAnimeList API for top lists, ratings & relations.
# - MangaDex (REST): Public API for manga chapter lists & scanlations.
# (No environment variables needed for these!)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. TMDB (Optional - Movies, TV Dramas & Live-Action GL)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A fallback demo key is already included in code, but you can provide
# your own free API key from https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api for
# higher personal rate limits:
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY="your_tmdb_api_key"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. FIRECRAWL (Optional - Web Scraping / Web Novels)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you plan to crawl external web novel or fan fiction sites via Firecrawl:
VITE_FIRECRAWL_API_KEY="your_firecrawl_api_key"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. APP CONFIGURATION
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
VITE_APP_NAME="YuriVerse"
